      }
     ],
     "value": "May play a role in anterograde transport of membrane proteins from the endoplasmic reticulum to the Golgi. May be involved in CASP8-mediated apoptosis (By similarity)"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "FUNCTION"
  },
  {
   "texts": [
