       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250"
      },
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "25327138"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Homodimer (PubMed:25327138). Heterodimer with BCAP31. Binds CASP8 (isoform 9) as a complex containing BCAP31, BCAP29, BCL2 and/or BCL2L1. Interacts with VAMP3, VAMP1 and membrane IgD immunoglobulins. May interact with ACTG1 and non-muscle myosin II (By similarity)"
    }
   ],
